[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 31566.11, "timestamp": "08:46:06", "text": "只能擁有其中一台。如果你有一台桌上型電腦或筆記型電腦（普通筆記型電腦），然後你還有一台舊的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 31568.944, "timestamp": "08:46:08", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "its hard to explain"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 31573.618, "timestamp": "08:46:13", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i can show you if you want"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 31577.51, "timestamp": "08:46:17", "text": "入門級遊戲本，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 31590.75, "timestamp": "08:46:30", "text": "我可以設定雙PC模式，這是其中一種。另一種情況是，如果我訂購一台筆記型電腦（普通筆記型電腦或桌上型電腦都可以），然後我有一台昂貴的安卓平板電腦，我可以用它來玩安卓遊戲。如果它是一台昂貴的平板電腦，它就會支援螢幕"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 31614.911, "timestamp": "08:46:54", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yeah that works, no hurry"}]